{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>He who sacrifices</b> — this is, \"he honors Me.\"" "<b>And sets a path</b> — one for whom the straight path has become clear, like \"they shall set and understand.\" And behold, the meaning of ישימו is like ישכילו, and the bet in ישע אלהים, like: \"I shall see it in My salvation.\""], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 50, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:31:29.505409339Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}